      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A standard, professional roof inspection in Utah typically costs between $100 and $400, with most average-sized homes landing right around $200 to $250.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $100 and $400"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "However, many local roofing companies across the Wasatch Front and Southern Utah provide free basic roof inspections if you suspect storm damage or are looking to get an estimate for repairs or replacement."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Cost Breakdown by Inspection Type"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you need an independent inspection (such as for a real estate transaction, an insurance certification, or an unbiased assessment), the price changes depending on the method used:"
